cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its data, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "covid-detection-rag: COVID-19 vaccine misinformation detection in YouTube videos with retrieval-augmented adjudication"
authors:
  - family-names: Pelizon
    given-names: Heloysa
    email: h.pelizon@edu.pucrs.br
