license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-11-16"
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.XXXXXXX"
    description: "Zenodo archive of the v1.0 release (fill in after deposit)"
keywords:
  - misinformation detection
  - fact-checking
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - COVID-19 vaccines
  - YouTube
  - speech transcription
abstract: >-
  A pipeline that collects YouTube videos about COVID-19 vaccines through the
  official Data API, transcribes their audio with faster-whisper, and flags
  claims that a vetted evidence corpus contradicts, using a locally served
  language model to adjudicate each claim against retrieved passages. Includes
  the hand-labelled test set, the development sets, the evidence passages and
  every experiment result reported in the thesis.
